EO decisions for this assignment. Do not execute or repeat the company interview or its inline note-saving operations as background work.: Inspected /private/var/folders/mx/w46p9btx1t17wv9tbsq885qw0000gn/T/richos-owned-desktop-78r77odk/company. (1) hello.txt exists (Glob '**/*' and '**/hello.txt'). (2) Read shows single line 'Hello Rich'. (3) Byte-exactness and absence of trailing newline verified by executed anchored multiline regex checks on the raw file: pattern '\\\\AHello Rich\\\\z' -> 1 match (hello.txt:1, 'Found 1 total occurrence'), proving the entire file haystack is exactly 'Hello Rich' with nothing following; pattern '\\\\AHello Rich\\\\n\\\\z' -> 0 matches ('Found 0 total occurrences'), proving no trailing LF. (4) Negative constraint 'do not create other files' satisfied: Glob '**/*' in the workspace returns only hello.txt and Glob '**/.*' returns no hidden files, so the workspace contains exactly one file. Parent directory could not be enumerated (reads outside the working directory are blocked by permissions.blockReadsOutsideWorkingDirectories), but the deliverable and its constraint are scoped to this workspace. No delegation/independent-review procedure was specified in this verbatim contract, so no separate implementer/reviewer receipt is required; all stated acceptance constraints are met.\"], retry_at: 1788940369382, review_pending: false, review_failures: 0, recovery_cycles: 2 }]","type":"text"}],"role":"user"},"type":"user"}
